 blocks","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/blockoverlay.svg"},{"id":"bossbar","name":"Boss Bar","description":"Customize your bossbar","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/bossbar.svg"},{"id":"brightness","name":"Brightness","description":"Adjust your Brightness Settings & Night Vision on demand.","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/brightness.svg"},{"id":"camera","name":"Camera","description":"Adds useful camera utilities","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/camera.svg"},{"id":"colorsaturation","name":"Color Saturation","description":"Adjust your display color saturation settings","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/colorsaturation.svg"},{"id":"combodisplay","name":"Combo Display","description":"Display number of consecutive hits","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/combodisplay.svg"},{"id":"coordinates","name":"Coordinates","description":"Display your location and world info","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/coordinates.svg"},{"id":"cosmetic","name":"Cosmetic","description":"Dawn cosmetic settings","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/hudselection/cosmetics.svg"},{"id":"cps","name":"CPS","description":"Show your clicks per second","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/cps.svg"},{"id":"culllogs","name":"Cull Logs","description":"Automatically remove old log files","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/culllogs.svg"},{"id":"customadvancementsscreen","name":"Custom Advancements Screen","description":"Show more information about advancement requirements","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/customadvancementsscreen.svg"},{"id":"customchat","name":"Custom Chat","description":"Tweak your chat display","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/customchat.svg"},{"id":"customf3","name":"Custom F3","description":"Customize your debug screen","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/customf3.svg"},{"id":"customfog","name":"Custom Fog","description":"Custom fog settings and clear water","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/customfog.svg"},{"id":"damageindicator","name":"Damage Indicator","description":"Show mob health information","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/damageindicator2.svg"},{"id":"darkmode","name":"Dark Mode","description":"Dark mode for Minecraft GUI","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/darkmode.svg"},{"id":"deathinfo","name":"Death Info","description":"Show information on death","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/deathinfo.svg"},{"id":"direction","name":"Direction","description":"Display your cardinal direction","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/direction.svg"},{"id":"discord","name":"Discord","description":"Share your current status on Discord","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/discord.svg"},{"id":"dropprevention","name":"Drop Prevention","description":"Lock items in your hotbar","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/dropprevention.svg"},{"id":"elytras","name":"Elytras","description":"Extra elytra features and chestplate swapping","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/elytras.svg"},{"id":"fovchanger","name":"FOV Changer","description":"Customize field of view","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/fovchanger.svg"},{"id":"fps","name":"FPS","description":"Display your frames per second","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/fps.svg"},{"id":"glint","name":"Glint","description":"Customize color of enchants and other settings","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/glint.svg"},{"id":"graphics","name":"Graphics","description":"Graphic and visual settings","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/sidebar/graphics.svg"},{"id":"hearts","name":"Hearts","description":"Replaces multiple vanilla heart rows with a single row","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/hearts.svg"},{"id":"hitbox","name":"Hitbox","description":"Adds hitboxes around entities","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/hitbox.svg"},{"id":"hitindicator","name":"Hit Indicator","description":"Add indicators where you receive damage","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/hitindicator.svg"},{"id":"horses","name":"Horses","description":"Add extra features and stats to horses","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/horses.svg"},{"id":"hypixel","name":"Hypixel","description":"Useful mods for Hypixel","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/hypixel.svg"},{"id":"inventory","name":"Inventory","description":"Useful mods for inventory management","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/inventory.svg"},{"id":"itemcounter","name":"Item Counter","description":"Count items in your inventory","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/itemcounter.svg"},{"id":"itemdespawn","name":"Item Despawn","description":"Make items flash when they\'re about to despawn","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/itemdespawn.svg"},{"id":"iteminfo","name":"Item Info","description":"Display enchants when picking up an item","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/iteminfo.svg"},{"id":"itemphysic","name":"Item Physic","description":"Cool item dropping physics","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/itemphysic.svg"},{"id":"jumpreset","name":"Jump Reset","description":"Notifies the player about how close they were to achieving a successful jump reset","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/jumpreset.svg"},{"id":"keystrokes","name":"Keystrokes","description":"Display your key presses","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/keystrokes.svg"},{"id":"lightleveloverlay","name":"Light Level Overlay","description":"Displays overlay indicating light levels","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/lightleveloverlay.svg"},{"id":"lootbeams","name":"Loot Beams","description":"Add beam to dropped items","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/lootbeams.svg"},{"id":"moboverlay","name":"Mob Overlay","description":"Add overlay and outline to mobs","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/moboverlay.svg"},{"id":"motionblur","name":"Motion Blur","description":"Blur your vision, make sure it\'s not too high","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/motionblur.svg"},{"id":"mousestrokes","name":"Mousestrokes","description":"Displays mouse movement","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/mousestrokes.svg"},{"id":"music","name":"Music","description":"Display and control music services in-game","icon":null},{"id":"nametags","name":"Nametags","description":"Modify nametag mechanics","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/nametags.svg"},{"id":"nickhider","name":"Nick Hider","description":"Hide your nick and skin","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/nickhider.svg"},{"id":"packdisplay","name":"Pack Display","description":"Displays your current texture pack","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/packdisplay.svg"},{"id":"packorganizer","name":"Pack Organizer","description":"Improved resource pack page w/ folder support and extra features","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/packorganizer.svg"},{"id":"particles","name":"Particles","description":"Customize particle settings","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/particles.svg"},{"id":"performance","name":"Performance","description":"Extra performance options","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/sidebar/performance.svg"},{"id":"perspective","name":"Perspective","description":"Freelook","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/perspective.svg"},{"id":"ping","name":"Ping","description":"Display your ping to the server","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/ping.svg"},{"id":"playermodel","name":"Player Model","description":"Render your player model in HUD","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/assets/game/mods/playermodel.svg"},{"id":"playtime","name":"Playtime","description":"Show time game open or in-game","icon":"https://assets.dawn.gg/asse