wn, every profile has its own world saves, shaders, resource packs, Minecraft settings, Dawn settings, and more — an isolated, perfect setup you can play without ever affecting your other profiles.",image:"/img/launcher-features/createprofiles.png",imageAlt:"Dawn launcher profile-creation modal with name, mod loader, Minecraft version, and loader version inputs.",editions:["java"]},{id:"mods",title:"Browse and add mods",subtitle:"Add mods to any profile by pressing Add Content. Use our lightweight mod browser to find every popular mod for your Minecraft version. Powered by Modrinth.",image:"/img/launcher-features/browseandaddmods.png",imageAlt:"Dawn launcher profile content view listing installed mods with an Add Content button and a filterable Modrinth-backed browser.",editions:["java"]},{id:"modpacks",title:"Download modpacks",subtitle:"Browse modpacks straight from Modrinth inside the Dawn launcher and spin up a profile from any of them in one click. Keep the mods updated automatically and switch modpack versions whenever you like.",image:"/img/launcher-features/downloadmodpacks.png",imageAlt:"Dawn launcher browsing Modrinth modpacks with one-click install: Fabulously Optimized, Cobblemon, Better MC, Sodium Plus listed.",editions:["java"]},{id:"multi-instance",title:"Launch multiple instances",subtitle:"Launch multiple instances of the same profile or of different profiles at once. Want four copies of Minecraft open under different accounts and on different versions? No problem.",image:"/img/launcher-features/launchmultipleinstances.png",imageAlt:"Dawn launcher launching several Minecraft instances at once under different accounts and versions.",editions:["java"]},{id:"logs",title:"Per-instance log viewer",subtitle:"Watch live logs, export them to share, and pull CPU and playtime stats from every running instance. Each one is isolated in its own searchable console.",image:"/img/launcher-features/logswindow.png",imageAlt:"Dawn launcher per-instance console: live log stream with playtime, CPU, memory, line count, and exit-code stats plus Export and Terminate controls.",editions:["java"]},{id:"servers",title:"Host free servers",subtitle:"Host free Minecraft servers right from the Dawn launcher, with perfect latency and ping for players anywhere in the world. They run on your own PC, under your control, but route through our state-of-the-art proxies around the globe for amazing connectivity.",image:"/img/launcher-features/freeservers.png",imageAlt:"Dawn launcher hosting a free Minecraft server routed through global proxies for low-latency connectivity.",editions:["java"]},{id:"cosmetics",title:"Cosmetics",subtitle:"Edit your look right in the Dawn launcher and show everyone else on Dawn just how cool you are.",image:"/img/launcher-features/cosmetics.png",imageAlt:"Dawn launcher cosmetics editor for customizing your in-game appearance.",editions:["java"]}],g=[{id:"armor-status",title:"Armor Status",subtitle:"See the durability of every armor piece and the item in your hand at a glance. Pick a layout, recolor it, and pin it anywhere on screen.",image:"/img/client-features/armorhud.png",imageAlt:"Dawn client Armor Status module config: text color, dynamic color, damage display type, alignment, tool location, and an in-game HUD preview showing helmet, chestplate, leggings, boots, sword, and shield durability.",editions:["java"]},{id:"fps-counter",title:"FPS Counter",subtitle:"Keep an eye on your live framerate with a lightweight on-screen counter. Style the text and colors and pin it wherever you like.",image:"/img/client-features/fpscounter.png",imageAlt:"Dawn client FPS Counter module config: text and color styling options with an in-game HUD preview showing the current frames-per-second readout.",editions:["java"]},{id:"keystrokes",title:"Keystrokes",subtitle:"Show your movement keys, mouse buttons, and live CPS in a tidy keystroke HUD. Style the background, border, and animation, and add or remove any key.",image:"/img/client-features/keystrokes.png",imageAlt:"Dawn client Keystrokes module config: background and border styling, fade animation, and an in-game preview of WASD + LMB / RMB + 0 CPS counter.",editions:["java"]},{id:"voice-chat",title:"Voice Chat",subtitle:"Talk to other Dawn players with low-latency proximity and party voice. Pick your push-to-talk keys, capture device, and HUD indicator.",image:"/img/client-features/voicechat.png",imageAlt:"Dawn client Voice module config: receive mode, HUD indicator toggle, proximity and party push-to-talk hotkeys, voice activation type, and capture device.",editions:["java"]},{id:"sprint-toggle",title:"Sprint Toggle",subtitle:"Toggle sprint and sneak with a single press instead of holding the keys down. Optional fly-boost, block-sprint guard, and a styled on-screen indicator.",image:"/img/client-features/sprinttoggle.png",imageAlt:'Dawn client Sprint Toggle module config: toggle sprint and sneak switches, fly settings (block sprint, toggle boost, boost amount), and an in-game preview labelled "Sprinting (Toggled)".',editions:["java"]}];var u=e.i(8003);function p(){return(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(l,{variant:"pink",titleGradient:"mc-text-pink",eyebrow:"Ingame Java Client",title:"CLIENT",intro:"Voice chat, waypoints, screenshots, FPS improvements, zoom, and 100+ more modules. Every one toggleable and customizable.",slides:g,imageSide:"right",withModuleMarquee:!0}),(0,t.jsx)(u.default,{instance:"a"}),(0,t.jsx)(l,{variant:"primary",titleGradient:"mc-text-active",eyebrow:"First Custom Cross-Platform Launcher",title:"LAUNCHER",intro:"The most customizable Minecraft launcher. Unlimited profiles, one-click Modrinth modpacks, multi-instance support, and a built-in log viewer.",slides:m,imageSide:"left"})]})}e.s(["LauncherAndClient",0,p,"default",0,p],4578)},84818,e=>{"use strict";var t=e.i(43476),s=e.i(71645),a=e.i(42310);function i({kits:e,intervalMs:a=3500}){let[r,l]=s.useState(0),[d,c]=s.useState(!1),[m,g]=s.useState(!1),u=s.useRef